#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9464
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "The pirate code's more like guidelines than actual rules."
msgstr "The pirate code's more like guidelines than actual rules."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9466
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Where aarrrr they going?"
msgstr "Where aarrrr they going?"

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9469
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "It's bad form to shoot a man in the middle of his cadenza."
msgstr "It's bad form to shoot a man in the middle of his cadenza."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9473
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "There's a bit of bravery in everyone, even if they don't know it."
msgstr "There's a bit of bravery in everyone, even if they don't know it."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9477
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "A good pirate never shows his true colors."
msgstr "A good pirate never shows his true colours."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9481
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "It's not the size of the ship, but the captain's heart that matters."
msgstr "It's not the size of the ship, but the captain's heart that matters."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9485
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Always remember, laughter is the best medicine, especially when you're "
"sailing through tough times."
msgstr ""
"Always remember, laughter is the best medicine, especially when you're "
"sailing through tough times."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9487
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Not all treasure is silver and gold."
msgstr "Not all treasure is silver and gold."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9488
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Why join the navy if you can be a pirate?"
msgstr "Why join the navy if you can be a pirate?"

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9489
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Work like a captain, play like a pirate."
msgstr "Work like a captain, play like a pirate."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9492
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "May your blade always be wet and your powder dry."
msgstr "May your blade always be wet and your powder dry."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9494
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Ahoy matey! Let's trouble the water!"
msgstr "Ahoy matey! Let's trouble the water!"

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9495
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Shiver me timbers."
msgstr "Shiver me timbers."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9496
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Avast, ye scurvy dog."
msgstr "Avast, ye scurvy dog."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9497
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Batten down the hatches."
msgstr "Batten down the hatches."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9498
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Here be treasure, matey."
msgstr "Here be treasure, matey."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9499
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Yo ho ho and a bottle of coolant."
msgstr "Yo ho ho and a bottle of coolant."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9502
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "A merry life and a short one shall be my motto."
msgstr "A merry life and a short one shall be my motto."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9506
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Every generation welcomes the pirates from the last."
msgstr "Every generation welcomes the pirates from the last."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9510
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "When a pirate grows rich enough, they make him a prince."
msgstr "When a pirate grows rich enough, they make him a prince."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9514
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "It is when pirates count their booty that they become mere thieves."
msgstr "It is when pirates count their booty that they become mere thieves."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9516
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Take what you can, give nothing back."
msgstr "Take what you can, give nothing back."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9519
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"In politics and trade, bruisers and pirates are of better promise than "
"talkers and clerks."
msgstr ""
"In politics and trade, bruisers and pirates are of better promise than "
"talkers and clerks."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9523
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "I am a man of fortune and must seek my fortune."
msgstr "I am a man of fortune and must seek my fortune."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9527
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "In an honest service, there is thin commons, low wages, and hard labor."
msgstr ""
"In an honest service, there is thin commons, low wages, and hard labour."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9531
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Revenge may sate your being, but don't misunderstand me. It's an end, not a "
"beginning."
msgstr ""
"Revenge may sate your being, but don't misunderstand me. It's an end, not a "
"beginning."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9535
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Betrayin's all part of piratin'. If you don't know that, you're not even "
"close to being a pirate."
msgstr ""
"Betrayin's all part of piratin'. If you don't know that, you're not even "
"close to being a pirate."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9539
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Aye, the sea whispers secrets only the brave dare to listen."
msgstr "Aye, the sea whispers secrets only the brave dare to listen."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9543
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Ye have the heart of a sea serpent - cold and deep as the abyss itself."
msgstr ""
"Ye have the heart of a sea serpent - cold and deep as the abyss itself."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9547
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Weigh anchor! The dawn's light brings promise of plunder and glory."
msgstr "Weigh anchor! The dawn's light brings promise of plunder and glory."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9551
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Let the sea's song guide us to untold riches, hidden where X marks the spot."
msgstr ""
"Let the sea's song guide us to untold riches, hidden where X marks the spot."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9555
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Marooned by fate, saved by wit and will - such is the pirate's plight."
msgstr "Marooned by fate, saved by wit and will - such is the pirate's plight."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9559
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"A chest of gold, a bottle of rum, and a sky alight with stars - pirate's "
"paradise."
msgstr ""
"A chest of gold, a bottle of rum, and a sky alight with stars - pirate's "
"paradise."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9563
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Coolant's the fuel that stirs the soul and emboldens the spirit of adventure."
msgstr ""
"Coolant's the fuel that stirs the soul and emboldens the spirit of adventure."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9567
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "A sword's edge and a cunning mind carve the path to treasures untold."
msgstr "A sword's edge and a cunning mind carve the path to treasures untold."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9571
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Let no man be called a landlubber when the call of the ocean beckons his "
"heart."
msgstr ""
"Let no man be called a landlubber when the call of the ocean beckons his "
"heart."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9575
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"The code of the sea is written in the blood of those who dare to defy it."
msgstr ""
"The code of the sea is written in the blood of those who dare to defy it."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9579
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Only in the dead of night, under the moon's watchful eye, do true pirates "
"ply their trade."
msgstr ""
"Only in the dead of night, under the moon's watchful eye, do true pirates "
"ply their trade."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9583
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"The call of the deep is a siren's song, luring the unwary to their doom or "
"glory."
msgstr ""
"The call of the deep is a siren's song, luring the unwary to their doom or "
"glory."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9587
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"In the shadow of the mast, we find solace in the brotherhood of outcasts."
msgstr ""
"In the shadow of the mast, we find solace in the brotherhood of outcasts."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9591
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"The gleam of treasure is not in its worth, but in the adventure it promises."
msgstr ""
"The gleam of treasure is not in its worth, but in the adventure it promises."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9595
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Gold and glory, the twin sirens that lead us through peril to paradise."
msgstr ""
"Gold and glory, the twin sirens that lead us through peril to paradise."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9599
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Let our laughter echo across the waves, a testament to the joy found in "
"lawlessness."
msgstr ""
"Let our laughter echo across the waves, a testament to the joy found in "
"lawlessness."

#: scripts/scenario_44_defenders_or_pirates.lua:9603
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"We are the shadows that slip through the night, the whisper of danger on the "
"wind."
msgstr ""
"We are the shadows that slip through the night, the whisper of danger on the "
"wind."

